532130be-7e25-4965-88ee-0a0f14fdcfc3	Customer Report	The customer submitted a report regarding a recent issue experienced with the service, highlighting delays in response time and occasional s	manual	The customer submitted a report regarding a recent issue experienced with the service, highlighting delays in response time and occasional system errors during usage. The report indicates that while the overall functionality meets expectations, there are inconsistencies that affect user experience, particularly during peak hours. The customer also noted that support responses were helpful but not always timely. Recommendations include improving system stability, optimizing performance under high load, and enhancing customer support responsiveness to ensure a smoother and more reliable service experience moving forward.	\N	\N	\N	2026-04-24 09:11:59.508799+00	\N	19e9e594-0495-43fd-acdf-19c6cd5f607a	The customer submitted a report regarding a recent issue experienced with the service, highlighting delays in response time and occasional system errors during usage. The report indicates that while the overall functionality meets expectations, there are inconsistencies that affect user experience, particularly during peak hours. The customer also noted that support responses were helpful but not always timely. Recommendations include improving system stability, optimizing performance under high load, and enhancing customer support responsiveness to ensure a smoother and more reliable service experience moving forward.	{"title":"Customer Report","summary_steps":"This is a customer report detailing service issues and providing recommendations for improvement.","key_points":"• Customer reported delays and occasional system errors during service usage\\n• Overall functionality meets expectations but inconsistencies affect user experience during peak hours\\n• Support responses were helpful but not always timely\\n• Recommendations: improve system stability, optimize performance u